OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh NHS bosses call for
OL,4,Amulti-year health funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior Welsh NHS bosses are calling on
OL,7,Fthe Welsh government to provide
OL,8,Fmulti-year funding settlements for
OL,9,Fhealth rather than relying on annual
OL,10,Fbudgets.
OL,12,FNext week, ministers will unveil draft
OL,13,Fspending plans for all public services
OL,14,Ffor the 2027-28 financial year.
OL,16,FThe NHS accounts for almost half of the
OL,17,FWelsh government's #27.5bn annual
OL,18,Fbudget, but health leaders say one-year
OL,19,Ffunding settlements can constrain
OL,20,Flong-term planning and transformation.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
